  (text "ACT capacitance: 40 uF here + 30 uF at button drivers (nominal; DC bias/tolerance reduce storage).\nD2 SMBJ6.0A: 6 V standoff; 6.67-7.37 V breakdown; 10.3 V pulse clamp at datasheet test current.\nD1 SMBJ12A protects U12 input; U12 OVLO protects the downstream rails. U13 blocks actuator reverse power. 1k bleeder discharges the rail; IN gates remove drive immediately.\nTVS is a pulse absorber, not a continuous wheel brake. Measured winding/motor energy and clamp/thermal tests remain layout gates."
    (at 20 240 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "774d96a8-bfce-588b-9918-c8d1d8cf4d38"))
